  "answer_text": "At Gate_MainEntrance on 2025-12-08 (UTC), person_entry counts by hour_utc are:\n- 00 (2025-12-08T00:00:00Z): 13\n- 01 (2025-12-08T01:00:00Z): 18\n- 02 (2025-12-08T02:00:00Z): 8\n- 03 (2025-12-08T03:00:00Z): 12\n- 04 (2025-12-08T04:00:00Z): 8\n- 05 (2025-12-08T05:00:00Z): 15\n- 06 (2025-12-08T06:00:00Z): 10\n- 07 (2025-12-08T07:00:00Z): 7\n- 08 (2025-12-08T08:00:00Z): 311\n- 09 (2025-12-08T09:00:00Z): 334\n- 10 (2025-12-08T10:00:00Z): 9\n- 11 (2025-12-08T11:00:00Z): 12\n- 12 (2025-12-08T12:00:00Z): 154\n- 13 (2025-12-08T13:00:00Z): 14\n- 14 (2025-12-08T14:00:00Z): 8\n- 15 (2025-12-08T15:00:00Z): 13\n- 16 (2025-12-08T16:00:00Z): 12\n- 17 (2025-12-08T17:00:00Z): 268\n- 18 (2025-12-08T18:00:00Z): 255\n- 19 (2025-12-08T19:00:00Z): 14\n- 20 (2025-12-08T20:00:00Z): 12\n- 21 (2025-12-08T21:00:00Z): 11\n- 22 (2025-12-08T22:00:00Z): 7\n- 23 (2025-12-08T23:00:00Z): 6",
